        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2) Crowns, inlays, or onlays on the same tooth are covered once in a five (5)-year period. Stainless steel crowns are covered once in a two (2)-year period. If a tooth can be restored with a filling material such as amalgam, silicate, or plastic, an allowance is made toward the cost of any other type of restoration.",
